<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So, you’re that new kid I heard about. And here I thought I’d remain one of the newest kids here.”</span> He laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But I’m glad we’ve got some fresh meat. Most of the other boys here are so basic and boring. Either that, or they try to act tough but are really just weak bitches. So, which one are you?”</span> He leans in with a devious smirk, causing you to nervously blurt out that you don’t know what he’s getting at. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> frowns and rolls his eyes, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Damn, is everyone in this country a damn coward? Back in Japan, I could always find boys willing to cause a little trouble.”</span> <br>
