You are a bit unsure, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kazu</span> is clearly a bad influence, and you get the feeling that hanging out with him will get you in quite a bit of trouble. Then again, it could be fun, and you get the feeling he may be a bit lonelier than he’s letting on. While you don’t give an exact answer, you continue to talk with him for the remainder of the bus ride and make a mental note to keep an eye out for him in the future. <span style="color:Yellow">Who knows? Maybe hanging out with a bad boy like him will make for some good life experience.</span> <br>
